The height is 3.
The width is 3.
The operations is a list of 2, 2, 3, 3.
The pairs is the number of items in operations divided by 2.
The rowlimit is height.
The columnlimit is width.
For every pair from 0 to pairs minus 1.
The row is item (pair times 2) of operations.
The column is item (pair times 2 plus 1) of operations.
If row is less than rowlimit, set rowlimit to row.
If column is less than columnlimit, set columnlimit to column.

The cells is rowlimit times columnlimit.
Show cells.
